# UI & UX Refinement Plan 🎨

Aapne bilkul sahi point out kiya: Backend algorithms (OATS, AI ETA, MVCC) perfect chal rahe hain, par jab tak unka data frontend par properly render nahi hota, user experience kharab ho jata hai. 

Main aapki CSS styling (Glassmorphism, gradients, hover effects) ko bilkul disturb kiye bina, backend data mapping ko theek karunga taaki "multiple duplicate routes" aur "empty tracking" wale issues fix ho jayein.

